48,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,The weather days show six weeks lost to rain on exposed work.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The renewal reserve for AV kit was never opened, which is a financial gap.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Toshio,,We need a project that uses general space effectively.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,A project that minimizes room closures would be ideal.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
