53,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,We should avoid projects that are exposed to weather or rely on comfort arguments.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,We must ensure the budget accounts for rising mechanical costs and lack of reserves.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
